            "review_title": "Review at Bar W",
            "review_text": "Tori Goe\nChiba Prefecture, Japan47 contributions\n0\nA safe and secure bar for tourists by Japanese professional bartenders\nJan 2025 • Friends\nI went sightseeing in Ho Chi Minh City, visited with a friend.\nIt was an authentic bar with a Japanese bartender, a seemingly safe space.\nThe owner-bartender, Watanabe-san, shares with us stories about his life in Ho Chi Minh City and his experiences about real Vietnamese people, which you can't hear anywhere else.\n\nCocktails made with Vietnamese gin and cocktails made with Vietnamese fruit were also rare and delicious.\n\nThe next time I went to Ho Chi Minh City, I left promising to meet again. The price was reasonable and I was relieved. It's really great to meet people like this while traveling. It was a great memory of the trip, thank you.\nRead more\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten February 26, 2025",
